			"crc": "CRC-16/CCITT-FALSE"
		},
		"notes": [
			"G900 shares the ambidextrous 11-record family with G903; installed side-button caps determine which controls are physically present.",
			"productIDs are the mouse's own reported IDs (0xC081 wired-cable/dongle mode, 0x4053 direct wireless mode), not 0xC539, which is the shared Lightspeed Receiver dongle's own USB ID and does not identify any specific mouse. 0xC539 previously collided with g502-lightspeed.json."
		]
